<Legal
  title="Privacy policy – EVicons"
  heading="Privacy policy"
  description="Privacy policy for evicons.dev: no cookies, server logs, self-hosted cookieless statistics and map tiles."
>
  <h2 id="controller">Controller</h2>
  <p>The controller responsible for processing personal data on this website within the meaning of the GDPR is:</p>
  <address>
    Abdellatif Landolsi<br />
    Landolsi Digital<br />
    Loisachstraße 7<br />
    83026 Rosenheim, Germany<br />
    Phone: <a href="tel:+4980312727300">+49 8031 27 27 300</a><br />
